{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:67113d22c8c13cca31c6e6c9e51fc03d9c4b3f7e557c02ce6d98ff5d5a5040ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f8df1e8d22482f4317ee5334a15c97d7e49b095afe34f6e51f0c7bfdb1acc52",
      "text": "唔——……就算你问我是不是对偶像感兴趣，\n我也搞不太懂。玄武你呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca91c87c4fd45a8699d9af32a5efdf943c85345d4812e3607d529b4631ba1945",
      "text": "我也一样。……不对，抱歉啊。\n明明是你的东西，我还盯着看个不停。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:decfa40e920356b5516e4383261b7ad3333a00c67f87e337620a02f4bb489f30",
      "text": "好，这样就全齐了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35248327c405d263a4641d4b06c6baec3feda3a9524a9132fa50660d457bf502",
      "text": "喂，我们把袋子要来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d77e600585c372f3a3bf7c22dee6c9cee4a8e3a37c245c5fec1dbd127419e924",
      "text": "谢啦！……好嘞，差不多这样就行了。\n套了两层袋子，这下不会再破了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f9a8c9022a569d8b16eb431c392c6b6bec1c29c25036196ad167498e541885",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n真的帮大忙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8acc2cc12df6eb4c71230fc64cfe9691a7f7a8f2c4cff885275aaf46bc9ff1a",
      "text": "那我们就先走了。……嗯？\n喂，朱雀。那边那个金头发的人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:323b649cfd8225915c92f79db130fcb2ab077ed662aeefd7a8f19f36a51049fd",
      "text": "是观光客吗？好像是语言不通，\n找不到路正犯愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe2745ea8d8b54b1333a467352dc28495a05f58cce252d57e8588523190f166",
      "text": "虽说如此，我又不会讲英语……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e84742234844b4032dd9ff20ebabdb110e05185519bc5ab5b597f637ecb7e26",
      "text": "如果只是日常对话的程度，就交给我吧。\n走吧，朱雀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e453ce741883f2640c0343ba0234a0d8e397bb0aa54dd093a6a843686f79ea",
      "text": "嘿嘿，连英语都会讲，真不愧是玄武！\n回见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d9b3c22a8cec72d3f1f0396eed707d3f4bae733b8383d100a7a2b2d2ecae30c",
      "text": "啊，那个！\n……已经走了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_01_1_1_009_01:1_1_009_01_j:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6be4efaca388ab4aa525812052f7f2d78653a3ea297659346f4cc8c2b2efe3",
      "text": "朱雀先生，和玄武先生吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
